      "id": "mission-room-system-wiring--note-1-exists-means-reusable-to",
      "kind": "comment",
      "label": "EXISTS means reusable today; PARTIAL means incomplete; CREATE means missing. Most infrastructure already exists—the real build remains Mission Linkage plus Mission View.",
